<title>USA: MGIC Investment Corp Q4 net up.</title>
<headline>MGIC Investment Corp Q4 net up.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.19		    $0.99</p>
<p> Net			 71,096		   58,738</p>
<p> Revs		     199,047		  169,780</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  59,575		   59,381</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1996 revenues include $165.3 million in net premiums written vs $136.5 million.</p>
<p>Q4 1996 revenues include $241,000 in realized gains vs $1,453,000.  </p>
<p>		     YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			  $4.33		    $3.50</p>
<p> Net			257,991		  207,565</p>
<p> Revs		     745,631		  617,886</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  59,523		   59,284</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full-year 1996 total revenues included $588.9 million in net premiums written vs $480.3 million. Full-year 1996 revenues also include $1,220,000 in realized gains vs $1,496,000.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
